WEBVTT

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:08.133 line:75% position:67% align:start size:30%
Start from My Day.
Open Insights in the desktop sidebar.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:13.900 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Read today first.
Today narrows the record to a single workday.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.667 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Compare the week.
7d expands the chart and recalculates the recorded totals.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:26.433 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Take the longer view.
30d gives the month context, not a productivity score.

00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:32.000 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Look below the headline.
Plan reliability and record mix answer different questions.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.567 line:75% position:3% align:start size:30%
Keep evidence separate.
App usage is observed context — never proof of completion.

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:47.517 line:15% position:3% align:start size:30%
Inspect the daily record.
Open the breakdown for exact values and linked records.
